Subject: [PATCH 04253/11362] [conductor] In-process docs for PHASE A1 (ARC
 NORTH STAR; PRIMARY; HEADLINE; operator-directed) -- S2-v3 CORPUS-WIDE
 off-path trust gate. S2-v2 was genuine but tested only 5 of 25 games (CI
 [-0.478,+0.004] on n=5). S2-v3 attempts the FULL offline corpus, actively
 GENERATES diverse candidate engines per game, and settles whether the
 off-path structural energy beats the cheap accuracy gate at engine selection
 ROBUSTLY (>=15 effective of ~25), or whether diverse pools are only formable
 for a few games (a real finding).

